OL,3,GNEWSAFirst cow tests positive for
OL,4,Abluetongue virus in Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe virus is transmitted by insects
OL,7,Flike midges and experts believe an
OL,8,Finfected plume has brought the virus to
OL,9,FScotland from outbreaks in Northern
OL,10,FIreland, the Republic of Ireland, Isle
OL,11,Fof Man or the north of England.
